      {
        "id": 1,
        "description": "1. This chapter requires precise timing.\n2. You have to wait for the **gravity** to **switch** up.\n3. When it is two seconds away from flipping again, quickly walk forward and fall up.\n4. The **gravity** will then reverse, and you will need to aim yourself at the **switch** to deflect you to the right.\n5. You will then curve, and burst through the window.\n6. When you land and wake up, continue right to see the ending.",
